# GOLD-game gate ledger SSOT — encoding pins (added 2026-05-29 after a peer
# toolchain twice re-encoded these files to mojibake: BOM prepended, em-dashes
# and box-drawing chars corrupted). These two files are the single source of
# truth for gate status; keep them LF + plain text. A companion guard
# (scripts/check-gold-game-encoding.mjs, wired into pre-commit and
# `pnpm check:gold-game-encoding`) enforces BOM-free + pure-ASCII at commit time.

GATES.md       text eol=lf
verify-all.mjs text eol=lf

# All gate verifiers / sources in this dir are LF text too.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.js  text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.holo text eol=lf

# Receipts and configs are LF JSON.
*.json text eol=lf

# Binary game artifacts — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.exe binary
